{"start":"j:option","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:condition:bible:numbers/29/1/en/prior_printing"}}
{"text":"In the seventh month, on the first day of the month, you shall have a sacred assembly; you may not do any form of work, a day of Teruah shall it be for you."}
{"end":"j:option"}
{"start":"j:option","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:condition:bible:numbers/29/1/en/repetition_printing"}}
{"text":"In the seventh month on the first day of the month you shall have a sacred assembly. You may not do any form of work, a day of Teruah shall it be for you."}
{"end":"j:option"}
{"end":"t:choice"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/29/2","n":"2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"You shall prepare a whole-offering of sweet savour to the Lord, one young bullock, one ram, seven flawless lambs in their first year. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/29/3","n":"3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Their meal-offering shall be of flour mixed with oil, three tenths for the bullock, two tenths for the ram "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/29/4","n":"4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"and one tenth "}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n174.jpg","n":"76"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"tail":"for each of the seven lambs. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/29/5","n":"5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"And also one he-goat as a sin-offering to atone for you. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/29/6","n":"6"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Apart from the whole-offering of the new moon and its meal-offering and the regular whole-offering with its meal-offering and their drink-offerings according to their rule for a sweet savour, a fire offering to the Lord. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
